{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3faf65ac-c092-836a-8540-123c38c9512f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:51:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivone Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:49:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:49:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hi. Um, I'm sorry, is this the fire department? The non-emergency line? I think I might have dialed wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:49:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. You've got the right city, just a different office. Fire has its own line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:49:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, okay. I'm so sorry. I wrote the number on a sticky note and I'm on speakerphone, so I hope you can hear me alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:49:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Are you trying to reach them about an emergency? Because if it's an emergency you hang up and dial 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:49:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nothing like that. It's just a question about, um, a smoke detector. Nobody's in danger or anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:49:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay good. Then you want the fire department's non-emergency number. I can transfer you over, or I can give you the number to dial."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:50:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, a transfer would be great, if that's okay. But wait, can I ask something? I think I used the wrong area code. Is it not four-oh-one for everything there? I thought maybe there was a different one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one is right for Newport, that's the only one we use here. Probably just a digit off somewhere else in the number, not the area code."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So it wasn't the area code. [pause] I was so sure it was the area code. Sorry, I keep, um, getting this wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't worry about it, happens all the time. Hang on one second and I'll put you through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:50:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. And I'm sorry again. It just feels like it's been a long week already and it's only Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:50:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Hold on, I'm connecting you now. If it drops, call back and ask for Rosa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will. Thank you so much. Am I supposed to just stay on the line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, stay on, it'll ring over to them. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, bye."
    }
  ],
